WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.668
Pig went into the barn.

2
00:00:13.669 --> 00:00:17.722
He put on his cape.

3
00:00:17.723 --> 00:00:21.575
He put on his mask.

4
00:00:21.576 --> 00:00:25.235
Now he was Super Pig!

5
00:00:25.236 --> 00:00:31.940
"I am off to do good things!"

6
00:00:31.941 --> 00:00:37.394
"Ta-da! Cow, I am Super Pig!

7
00:00:37.395 --> 00:00:41.299
I am here to help you!"

8
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:49.519
"Oh!" said Cow. "Hello, Pig! I like your cape!"

9
00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:56.612
"I am not Pig. I am Super Pig!

10
00:00:56.613 --> 00:00:59.770
How can I help you, Cow?"

11
00:00:59.771 --> 00:01:03.304
"I'm just eating grass," said Cow.

12
00:01:03.305 --> 00:01:08.128
"I don't need any help."

13
00:01:08.129 --> 00:01:10.977
"Please," said Pig.

14
00:01:10.978 --> 00:01:14.352
"There must be something I can do."

15
00:01:14.353 --> 00:01:19.593
Cow thought and thought.

16
00:01:19.594 --> 00:01:25.476
"I like clover," she said at last.

17
00:01:25.477 --> 00:01:32.751
"But there are bees on the clover.

18
00:01:32.752 --> 00:01:37.873
Can you chase the bees away?"

19
00:01:37.874 --> 00:01:43.109
"Of course I can!" said Super Pig.

